<h2>What's new in v2.7.7</h2>

<h3>Inline release notes</h3>
<p>This update dialog now shows release notes directly, instead of opening
the GitHub page in a webview. Smaller dialog, no extra round-trip, works
offline.</p>

<h3>Maintenance</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Each release writes a per-version <code>notes/vX.Y.Z.html</code>
      file that's embedded into the appcast at build time.</li>
  <li>No changes to the input-method behavior or keymap — same v2.7.6
      detector and Sparkle wiring.</li>
</ul>
